  "goodToKnow": "Das Kabinett is the cabinet, the chancellor and the federal ministers: Das Kabinett beschließt den Haushalt. The word first meant a small room, which survives in Kabinettstück (a showpiece) and in the wine label Kabinett, the lightest category of German Prädikatswein. In museums, a Kabinett can also be a small room for a special exhibition. Its plural is die Kabinette."
